# Alembic

Migration scripts belong in `versions/`. No revisions are included in this
initial configuration.

Run Alembic commands from the `backend/` directory. The environment loads
`DATABASE_URL` from the backend Pydantic Settings and targets
`app.db.base.Base.metadata`.

When ORM models are added, import their modules into `alembic/env.py` before
using `--autogenerate` so their tables are registered in that metadata.
